sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant F as 前端
    participant G as Gin后端
    participant HP as hostpath模块
    participant FM as filemgr模块
    participant N as nsenter
    participant H as 宿主机PID 1
    participant S as Store数据库

    F->>G: POST /api/v1/scripts/execute
    G->>HP: Enabled()?
    HP-->>G: 容器模式状态
    G->>FM: resolveHostPath()
    FM-->>G: 映射后路径
    G->>N: exec.Command("nsenter","-m","-u","-i","-n","-p","-t","1",...)
    N->>H: 执行shell命令
    H-->>N: 命令输出
    N-->>G: CombinedOutput()
    G->>S: SaveAuditLog()
    S-->>G: 日志保存成功
    G-->>F: 返回执行结果JSON
